 "text": "Hi, how are you doing these days? Try thinking of them as places rather than moods. Think beach is busy and loud, mountain is quiet and clean, the fort is dark and secret. Okay, I' keep it moving. That's a zipped bag, you can put a full water bottle in and few changes of clothes. It is, but a bit of tape can hold it together. Sure, open it up and stick a few layers together. You can tape it together inside a store bag so it stays open. A light sweater and a water bottle are the key items. Then a thin jacket and that water bottle. Drama comes from strong winds you can't stand up in.",
